We redesigned IRCTC to make the platform simpler, faster, and more user-friendly. 
The homepage was decluttered by reducing unnecessary banners and highlighting key actions like ticket booking, PNR status, and trip management. 
The booking process was streamlined with a step-by-step flow and progress tracker, making it easier for users to complete reservations. 
Train search results were redesigned into clean, easy-to-compare cards, reducing information overload. 
We also improved mobile responsiveness, accessibility, typography, and navigation for a better experience across all user groups. 
Features like saved passengers, recent routes, and personalized trip information help make repeat bookings quicker and more convenient
